    "# Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG)\n",
    "\n",
    "We enhance the MCQ solver by incorporating Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG). Instead of relying solely on the model's internal knowledge, we first retrieve relevant information from a knowledge base using dense vector search (FAISS). The retrieved documents are then reranked using a Cross-Encoder to improve retrieval quality before being used to augment the question. This approach enables the model to answer questions using both retrieved context and transformer-based reasoning."
